# Copy to frontend/.env.local (git-ignored) to build against a remote backend.
#
# Leave UNSET for local dev — vite.config.ts proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# On Vercel, set this in Project → Settings → Environment Variables to your
# deployed backend URL (no trailing slash, no /api suffix):
#
# VITE_API_BASE=https://promptineer-api.onrender.com
